{%- comment -%}
  CARE HERO — the Care page's hero (Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava,
  Styles/_video-hero.scss), as Renew's and Outreach's.

  Block:                    an HTML block in the Care page's Feature zone
  Block content:            {% include '~~/Assets/Lava/CareHero.lava' %}
  Enabled Lava Commands:    none
  Page:                     InnerDefault, PageHeaderStyle Hidden, DarkHeader
                            checked

  The lead line under "Care" is the page's Description (Page Properties).
  The button opens the same care dialog as the utility bar's Request care
  link (data-care-trigger: theme.js "Care dialog", markup in UtilityBar.lava);
  without JavaScript it goes to the Request help form.
  No video yet: a labelled green placeholder stands in. When the video is in
  Rock, delete heroPlaceholder and set heroMediaId to its media element id.

  The page content under it: Assets/Lava/Care.lava (Main zone).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign heroPlaceholder = 'Video: Care' -%}
{%- capture heroActions -%}
  <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/care/request-help" data-care-trigger>Request care</a>
{%- endcapture -%}
{% include '~~/Assets/Lava/Partials/VideoHero.lava' %}
